WEBVTT

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:28.970
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:30.810 --> 00:00:34.210
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:36.410 --> 00:00:39.050
Calling everything delicious!

00:00:39.050 --> 00:00:43.550
The more I eat, the more powerful I get!

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:46.920
Let’s capture ingredients around the world!

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:51.500
I dream of being an invincible 
Gourmet Fighter!!

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:56.530
Now on to the bottom of the 
sea, or the tops of glaciers!

00:00:56.530 --> 00:00:59.200
Jump! Jump Jump Jump! 
Knock! Knock Knock Knock!

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:01.400
Give thanks!

00:01:01.400 --> 00:01:04.610
Let’s eat!

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:10.410
Wow wo!! Spiked Punch! Wow wo!! Multi-fold!

00:01:10.410 --> 00:01:15.550
Guts! Gutsy Guts! I can eat any dream!

00:01:15.550 --> 00:01:20.820
Wow wo!! My very own... 
Wow wo!! ...Full Course!

00:01:21.090 --> 00:01:24.990
Guts! Gutsy Guts! Gather them all up!

00:01:24.990 --> 00:01:31.070
And put the world on my plate!

00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:33.870
Wow wow wow! Eat the mountains!!

00:01:33.870 --> 00:01:36.440
Wow wow wow! Toriko!!

00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:39.040
Wow wow wow! Eat the oceans!!

00:01:39.040 --> 00:01:43.310
Wow wow wow! Tori, Tori, Tori, Toriko!!

00:01:47.150 --> 00:01:49.750
Someone once said:

00:01:50.250 --> 00:01:54.920
There is a valley filled 
with a piping hot mist,

00:01:54.920 --> 00:02:00.190
where each step brings you 
a crunchy, fragrant sound...

00:02:00.190 --> 00:02:04.300
The Croquette Valley!

00:02:05.400 --> 00:02:11.770
In the Custardgrounds, 
with soil made of custard,

00:02:11.770 --> 00:02:18.310
grows a chestnut tree which 
spouts all kinds of sweets,

00:02:18.310 --> 00:02:21.750
from cream puffs to cream 
zenzai, to éclairs...

00:02:21.750 --> 00:02:25.320
The Creamtree!

00:02:25.750 --> 00:02:28.520
The world is in the Gourmet Age!

00:02:28.520 --> 00:02:33.390
An age in which people quest for 
yet-unknown culinary delights!

00:02:35.900 --> 00:02:40.300
Toriko was successful in capturing the 
BB Corn after coming to the Wu Jungle.

00:02:41.700 --> 00:02:44.600
Meanwhile, Komatsu got 
the Woolstar Sauce fruit

00:02:44.600 --> 00:02:47.570
he needed to make the 
Gourmet Summit a success.

00:02:48.470 --> 00:02:52.510
Toriko created popcorn from the 
BB Corn and tried some with Terry.

00:02:53.850 --> 00:02:56.780
There, an emissary from the 
Gourmet Corp. appeared!

00:02:57.480 --> 00:03:00.090
Toriko learns that the Gourmet Corp. 
is after the same thing he is...

00:03:00.090 --> 00:03:03.720
GOD, the ingredient that 
stands above all others!

00:03:05.990 --> 00:03:10.860
Pressure of Madness! Grinpatch vs. Toriko!

00:03:15.000 --> 00:03:19.570
I think I could hack down a 
giant BB Corn, no problem!

00:03:19.570 --> 00:03:23.340
Flying Knife!

00:03:27.910 --> 00:03:30.980
That might just be enough 
to cut your outer skin,

00:03:30.980 --> 00:03:39.220
but pretty soon, even at this distance, 
I'll cut your life in half!

00:03:50.730 --> 00:03:52.670
Impressive, as I thought!

00:03:54.200 --> 00:03:59.140
Didn't think you could also 
attack at a distance...

00:03:59.140 --> 00:04:03.680
But if your attacks can't even 
break this rock at these distances,

00:04:03.680 --> 00:04:10.150
you can't really say you've overcome 
your weakness, your Achilles heel!

00:04:10.150 --> 00:04:11.720
Toriko...

00:04:13.160 --> 00:04:18.860
I'll show you the difference between your 
airgun that tickles and my missiles!

00:04:20.330 --> 00:04:27.870
Yes, that's right. At this stage, 
I need to damage you first.

00:04:29.370 --> 00:04:31.370
I'm fully aware of that!

00:04:33.580 --> 00:04:38.810
Take this, Toriko! My Long-Distance 
Breath Bazooka Cannon!

00:04:39.920 --> 00:04:42.650
Breath Missile!

00:04:43.820 --> 00:04:44.690
Now!

00:05:00.900 --> 00:05:02.100
Knife!

00:05:17.650 --> 00:05:20.590
I managed to cut that straw, somehow!

00:05:22.160 --> 00:05:24.830
How did you get behind me?

00:05:24.830 --> 00:05:28.200
The ground's temperature is 1200 degrees C!

00:05:29.860 --> 00:05:34.970
My first Flying Knife wasn't aiming at you.

00:05:34.970 --> 00:05:37.440
It was the surviving Magma Rats!

00:05:39.110 --> 00:05:42.410
That's right! Those are the 
hides of the Magma Rats.

00:05:42.410 --> 00:05:47.710
Then I purposefully provoked you 
to get you to do a big attack,

00:05:48.010 --> 00:05:53.620
and as I figured, you blew out an 
attack so big it limited your vision.

00:05:53.920 --> 00:05:59.930
I used that chance to jump over the 
Magma Rat hides and get up here!

00:05:59.930 --> 00:06:02.730
Even if my Knife and Fork have upgraded,

00:06:02.730 --> 00:06:07.330
there's no way I could actually 
damage you without moving in close.

00:06:08.030 --> 00:06:10.470
Impressive, Toriko!

00:06:10.470 --> 00:06:13.610
Crazy! I like it!

00:06:13.610 --> 00:06:17.380
This just got really damn interesting!

00:06:32.720 --> 00:06:35.330
Hey, what?! We were just 
gettin' to the good part!

00:06:35.330 --> 00:06:37.930
I'm gettin' called by the Chief Chef?

00:06:39.060 --> 00:06:42.000
That's all for today, Toriko!

00:06:43.400 --> 00:06:46.340
I gotta get back to headquarters.

00:06:46.340 --> 00:06:50.780
Well, and my pet's just returned, too.

00:06:50.780 --> 00:06:52.280
Finally.

00:07:03.090 --> 00:07:07.760
Jackelephant (Insect Beast) Capture Level 85

00:07:18.240 --> 00:07:21.240
Today was a lot of fun, Toriko!

00:07:21.240 --> 00:07:24.210
I couldn't think of a 
better way to kill time!

00:07:24.210 --> 00:07:27.440
Next time we meet, let's go all out!

00:07:34.380 --> 00:07:38.550
Hey, you! Give back that BB Corn you ate!

00:07:39.020 --> 00:07:43.530
You cut up my straw, so we're even.

00:07:43.530 --> 00:07:44.790
Later!

00:07:44.790 --> 00:07:45.960
We're even?!

00:07:45.960 --> 00:07:47.960
And hey, say your name, damn it!

00:07:48.400 --> 00:07:51.030
My name is Grinpatch!

00:07:51.030 --> 00:07:54.000
A Vice Chief Cook of the Gourmet Corp.!

00:08:04.050 --> 00:08:05.280
Terry!

00:08:06.080 --> 00:08:08.680
Good job getting out of the way, Terry.

00:08:08.680 --> 00:08:10.290
That's all I asked.

00:08:10.990 --> 00:08:14.690
Now we've really got to get a lot stronger.

00:08:15.490 --> 00:08:19.930
Grinpatch... He wasn't being serious at all.

00:08:20.500 --> 00:08:23.700
If a Vice Chief Cook of the 
Gourmet Corp. is that powerful...

00:08:36.710 --> 00:08:40.880
I really wanted to suck 
up Toriko and that dog!

00:08:40.880 --> 00:08:44.850
I guess I'll wait for them 
to grow just a little more...

00:09:05.140 --> 00:09:09.740
The dinner banquet of the Gourmet 
Summit will open shortly.

00:09:09.740 --> 00:09:14.810
But the chef of Hotel Gourmet, who is 
running the summit, has yet to be seen.

00:09:16.580 --> 00:09:20.420
In only 5 minutes, the peak flavor 
of the Bubbly Tuna will arrive.

00:09:20.420 --> 00:09:24.520
If it passes the peak by only one second, 
it can't be eaten any longer, yes?

00:09:24.520 --> 00:09:27.560
Chef Komatsu, please hurry back!

00:09:28.290 --> 00:09:31.160
If we can't satisfy President 
Dohem with this dish,

00:09:31.160 --> 00:09:34.000
we cannot pass the Gourmet Resolution.

00:09:34.000 --> 00:09:37.100
We must pass it for the peace of the world!

00:09:37.400 --> 00:09:38.740
You!

00:09:38.740 --> 00:09:42.870
Use the sauce Chef Komatsu made, 
and serve the Bubbly Tuna!

00:09:42.870 --> 00:09:45.280
But, this sauce wasn't finished...

00:09:45.280 --> 00:09:47.250
Better than not serving anything!

00:09:48.810 --> 00:09:50.180
If the summit is a failure,

00:09:50.180 --> 00:09:53.850
there is fear it could cause international 
strife, and it seems like...

00:10:13.270 --> 00:10:17.010
A beautiful and wild landing, 
if I say so myself.

00:10:18.340 --> 00:10:22.280
Please, just land on the roof...

00:10:22.280 --> 00:10:24.580
Land a bit more quietly, would you?

00:10:24.580 --> 00:10:26.080
But we had too many people on board!

00:10:26.080 --> 00:10:27.650
I could hardly control it!

00:10:27.650 --> 00:10:30.420
And I made it in time, barely, 
so what's yer problem?!

00:10:30.420 --> 00:10:31.590
Tina?!

00:10:31.990 --> 00:10:33.960
It seems to be Hotel Gourmet's Chef!

00:10:33.960 --> 00:10:35.860
A comment, if you please!

00:10:37.930 --> 00:10:40.160
Komatsu, hurry and go!

00:10:40.600 --> 00:10:41.560
Right!

00:10:42.400 --> 00:10:43.930
Wait!

00:10:43.930 --> 00:10:45.340
I'm counting on you, Tina!

00:10:46.870 --> 00:10:47.770
Right!

00:10:59.150 --> 00:11:01.120
This is Bubbly Tuna!

00:11:01.120 --> 00:11:05.320
In only 3 minutes, the Bubbly 
Tuna will reach its peak!

00:11:05.320 --> 00:11:07.320
Now, put on the sauce!

00:11:07.790 --> 00:11:09.090
R-Right...

00:11:18.630 --> 00:11:20.040
Komatsu-kun!

00:11:22.500 --> 00:11:28.540
I have to complete the recipe 
for the Bubbly Tuna!!

00:11:31.110 --> 00:11:32.750
There's no time!

00:11:37.590 --> 00:11:40.660
The Bubbly Tuna's peak is nearing!

00:11:48.760 --> 00:11:50.200
Please wait!

00:11:51.430 --> 00:11:53.030
Chef Komatsu!

00:11:53.030 --> 00:11:55.470
Wait with that sauce!

00:11:55.470 --> 00:11:58.370
Just a little more to that sauce...

00:11:58.370 --> 00:12:00.470
Please allow me to finish the preparation!

00:12:00.470 --> 00:12:01.810
W-What?

00:12:24.300 --> 00:12:28.700
Bubbly Tuna turns into 
bubbles when time runs out.

00:12:28.940 --> 00:12:31.200
Just like the ocean bubbles the 
mermaid princess turned into

00:12:31.200 --> 00:12:33.970
after her feelings never got 
through to her beloved...

00:12:34.170 --> 00:12:35.240
That is, in fact,

00:12:35.240 --> 00:12:38.610
where the name Bubbly Tuna 
comes from, the Mermaid Tuna...

00:12:38.610 --> 00:12:40.010
No...

00:12:42.820 --> 00:12:47.150
And you had me looking 
forward to some Bubbly Tuna!

00:12:47.150 --> 00:12:48.890
I could care less about this summit!

00:12:48.890 --> 00:12:50.390
I'm going back to my country!

00:12:50.390 --> 00:12:52.590
Please wait a moment, President!

00:12:52.590 --> 00:12:54.430
Please wait a little longer!

00:12:52.960 --> 00:12:54.430
I'm going back!

00:12:54.430 --> 00:12:56.760
Unhand me! Unhand me this instant!

00:12:55.530 --> 00:12:56.760
No...

00:12:56.760 --> 00:12:57.830
Komatsu-kun...

00:12:57.830 --> 00:13:00.930
That effort of yours won't 
disappear into bubbles.

00:13:00.930 --> 00:13:02.330
Coco-san?

00:13:02.330 --> 00:13:04.400
I thought this might happen.

00:13:07.970 --> 00:13:09.540
B-Bubbly Tuna?!

00:13:09.540 --> 00:13:10.540
What?!

00:13:11.110 --> 00:13:12.010
You see...

00:13:13.240 --> 00:13:17.650
Thanks to you telling us 
where to catch Mermaid Tuna,

00:13:17.650 --> 00:13:19.580
we pulled in three of them!

00:13:19.580 --> 00:13:22.750
These'll become big profits, no doubt!

00:13:23.550 --> 00:13:26.490
Kiss, you came to pick me up?

00:13:27.460 --> 00:13:29.660
Now, if you'll pardon me.

00:13:29.660 --> 00:13:35.300
As I promised, I'll be taking one 
Bubbly Tuna as payment for my fortune.

00:13:37.900 --> 00:13:41.670
And then I hurried here with the Bubbly Tuna.

00:13:42.710 --> 00:13:43.840
Coco-san!

00:13:43.840 --> 00:13:45.340
Coco, you're always the best!

00:13:46.280 --> 00:13:49.280
There he goes with the 
beautiful entrance again!

00:13:49.280 --> 00:13:50.410
It pisses me off!

00:13:51.510 --> 00:13:56.050
I know you went through the trouble, 
but that Bubbly Tuna cannot be eaten.

00:13:56.050 --> 00:14:02.130
Bubbly Tuna's flavor matures to its peak 
7 days after it's taken from the water.

00:14:02.130 --> 00:14:04.490
Fresh out of the water, its flavor is weak...

00:14:05.830 --> 00:14:11.330
No! If I use a sauce made from Woolstar 
Sauce fruit, the flavor should be full!

00:14:14.900 --> 00:14:17.210
Huh? Something's missing...

00:14:17.210 --> 00:14:20.040
That's it... It's not salty enough.

00:14:20.040 --> 00:14:22.110
I-I'll go get the salt!

00:14:22.110 --> 00:14:26.080
Normal salt won't be enough 
for the impact of this flavor.

00:14:26.080 --> 00:14:31.390
But why? Shouldn't the Woolstar 
Sauce fruit make the ultimate sauce?

00:14:31.390 --> 00:14:34.260
I suspect he picked the fruit too early.

00:14:34.820 --> 00:14:40.060
I hear that the Woolstar Sauce fruit absorbs 
minerals from the soil and becomes salty.

00:14:40.530 --> 00:14:44.770
He probably picked it before it 
had absorbed enough minerals.

00:14:45.170 --> 00:14:47.000
No...

00:14:47.170 --> 00:14:49.070
If you need salt, I got salt.

00:14:49.300 --> 00:14:51.510
T-Toriko-san!

00:14:51.510 --> 00:14:55.440
You! When did you... And why are you here?

00:14:55.680 --> 00:14:57.450
Anyway...

00:14:58.810 --> 00:15:02.820
Look! It's volcanic salt 
from the Wool Volcano!

00:15:03.280 --> 00:15:06.820
I brought it back to use on the BB Corn.

00:15:07.590 --> 00:15:09.890
I can always count on you, Toriko-san!

00:15:09.890 --> 00:15:13.690
E-E-Even Toriko has a beautiful entrance!

00:15:13.690 --> 00:15:15.900
Man, he pisses me off!

00:15:20.030 --> 00:15:24.270
The soil of the Wu Jungle is made 
from the ash of the Wool Volcano.

00:15:24.270 --> 00:15:28.740
If that's the case, the Woolstar Sauce 
and volcanic salt should match...

00:15:28.740 --> 00:15:30.610
...perfectly!

00:15:37.180 --> 00:15:39.690
The tuna is maturing!

00:15:40.090 --> 00:15:41.020
Go ahead.

00:15:42.720 --> 00:15:44.260
This is...

00:15:48.360 --> 00:15:52.930
The moment it touches my tongue, 
it disappears as if into bubbles!

00:15:55.270 --> 00:15:57.970
Such an incredibly gentle flavor!

00:15:58.200 --> 00:16:01.440
Tuna, shrimp, scallops, salmon...

00:16:01.970 --> 00:16:06.780
It's like the great bounty of the 
seas expanding inside of my mouth!

00:16:06.780 --> 00:16:08.250
And...

00:16:08.580 --> 00:16:11.180
...the sauce that compliments their flavor!

00:16:11.180 --> 00:16:15.050
Wild herbs, mushrooms, the taste of 
the great bounty of the mountains!

00:16:15.050 --> 00:16:18.090
This is the ultimate collaboration between

00:16:18.090 --> 00:16:21.130
the bounty of the seas and the mountains!

00:16:23.730 --> 00:16:29.500
The ultimate Bubbly Tuna, and an 
incredible sauce... Well done, Chef.

00:16:30.970 --> 00:16:32.670
Thank you very much.

00:16:34.940 --> 00:16:38.940
But, why did the Bubbly Tuna mature?

00:16:39.610 --> 00:16:44.520
I know! The growth rate of the creatures 
in the Wu Jungle is seriously fast!

00:16:45.180 --> 00:16:47.180
The Aloe from the Aloefrillnecked Lizard...

00:16:47.180 --> 00:16:49.990
It can increase the skin's 
regenerative metabolism.

00:16:49.990 --> 00:16:51.860
It's a great beauty product!

00:16:52.160 --> 00:16:54.020
The plants and animals from the jungle,

00:16:54.020 --> 00:16:58.730
including the Woolstar fruit, have 
the effect of accelerating growth.

00:16:58.730 --> 00:17:01.800
The power to mature ingredients' flavor...

00:17:01.800 --> 00:17:03.770
To draw out ingredients' flavor...

00:17:03.770 --> 00:17:06.400
That's indeed the ultimate sauce.

00:17:06.400 --> 00:17:10.910
And with Toriko's salt as final touch, the 
maturing stopped just at the right time.

00:17:10.910 --> 00:17:13.340
That's one excellent seasoning!

00:17:13.340 --> 00:17:17.210
President, about the resolution...

00:17:17.210 --> 00:17:22.990
With a chef that can serve food so 
delicious here, I'll believe in you, IGO.

00:17:22.990 --> 00:17:25.560
All right!

00:17:25.560 --> 00:17:27.720
You did it, Komatsu!

00:17:28.190 --> 00:17:31.290
Toriko-san, thank you very much!

00:17:31.290 --> 00:17:35.100
Oh yeah... Hey, bring it all in!

00:17:35.100 --> 00:17:38.270
I brought BB Corn back, just like I promised!

00:17:38.470 --> 00:17:41.300
That's BB Corn!

00:17:41.300 --> 00:17:45.470
I think if you put that 
Woolstar Sauce fruit and this

00:17:45.470 --> 00:17:48.010
on the BB Corn, it'll be even more delicious!

00:17:48.480 --> 00:17:53.480
Let's all eat the BB Corn to celebrate!

00:18:01.320 --> 00:18:06.490
Yum! The fragrant sauce makes 
the corn smell even better!

00:18:07.300 --> 00:18:11.770
My hand keep grabbing more, 
faster and faster! I can't stop!

00:18:11.770 --> 00:18:14.440
I ain't gonna lose to you youngsters yet!

00:18:16.470 --> 00:18:20.570
Coco-san! Your fortune-telling 
really saved me there.

00:18:20.570 --> 00:18:22.280
Thank you very much!

00:18:22.280 --> 00:18:24.480
I didn't do a thing.

00:18:24.710 --> 00:18:27.110
Komatsu-kun, it was your hard work.

00:18:31.990 --> 00:18:35.560
I wasn't able to have a beautiful 
entrance at all this time!

00:18:35.560 --> 00:18:37.360
I'm so frustrated I could eat forever!

00:18:38.330 --> 00:18:39.760
Yum!

00:18:40.260 --> 00:18:41.560
It's not on...

00:18:42.900 --> 00:18:46.230
Sunny's crazy landing broke it!

00:18:46.230 --> 00:18:48.300
I can't film this scoop in the end!

00:18:48.300 --> 00:18:50.300
My boss is gonna be a heaping helping of mad!

00:18:50.300 --> 00:18:53.140
You really came through, Chef Komatsu.

00:18:53.440 --> 00:18:56.410
Thanks to your cooking, the 
resolution will be passed.

00:18:56.940 --> 00:18:59.180
And with this, the world is saved.

00:19:00.010 --> 00:19:01.880
Now then, everyone...

00:19:01.880 --> 00:19:07.750
A resolution has been passed 
unanimously at this summit!

00:19:07.750 --> 00:19:10.690
For ET Rice sushi...

00:19:11.560 --> 00:19:16.600
Don't put the soy sauce on 
the rice, but on the topping!

00:19:16.600 --> 00:19:17.860
No objections!

00:19:23.070 --> 00:19:26.200
Do you really need a 
resolution to decide that?

00:19:26.200 --> 00:19:29.610
That's going to save the world?

00:19:32.610 --> 00:19:34.150
Delicious!

00:19:48.190 --> 00:19:51.430
Komatsu! Make a bunch more of this sauce!

00:19:51.430 --> 00:19:53.260
Yes, Toriko-san!

00:19:57.940 --> 00:20:01.940
I think you've had enough for 
today! So get lost! Shoo!

00:20:01.940 --> 00:20:05.410
How incredible merciful! As 
expected from Zonge-sama!

00:20:05.410 --> 00:20:08.410
If I get back alive, I'm gonna 
help out at my family's tofu shop!

00:20:08.410 --> 00:20:10.910
You family runs a tofu shop?!

00:20:29.030 --> 00:20:34.440
Gourmet Corp. Chief Chef Kuromado

00:20:34.700 --> 00:20:37.310
Is everyone still not here?

00:20:37.940 --> 00:20:42.210
Gourmet Corp. 2nd Branch Chairman Yuu

00:20:42.210 --> 00:20:46.320
Gourmet Corp. 3nd Branch Chairman Jelly Boy

00:20:46.320 --> 00:20:50.520
Gourmet Corp. 4th Branch Chairman Barrygamon

00:20:50.520 --> 00:20:54.790
Gourmet Corp. 5th Branch Chairman Bogie Woods

00:20:54.790 --> 00:20:59.190
Gourmet Corp. 6th Branch Chairman Cedre

00:20:59.190 --> 00:21:02.960
You fail to gather before me...

00:21:02.960 --> 00:21:07.940
I remember how dependable you once were...

00:21:08.200 --> 00:21:10.970
But your failure to capture 
the Jewel Meat aside...

00:21:10.970 --> 00:21:14.080
I've got to get you to focus more, don't I?

00:21:15.340 --> 00:21:21.150
Understand this! GOD will soon 
show itself in the Gourmet World!

00:21:23.820 --> 00:21:29.520
With GOD, the boss can take control 
of all the ingredients in the world!

00:21:30.290 --> 00:21:34.260
Obtain GOD, no matter the cost!

00:21:42.440 --> 00:21:48.110
Is the night wind, caressing my cheek

00:21:48.640 --> 00:21:54.380
proof the world is spinning, I wonder?

00:21:55.120 --> 00:22:01.620
Each time I move out, the 
direction of the wind changes.

00:22:02.020 --> 00:22:06.560
Maybe that’s telling me something.

00:22:07.830 --> 00:22:11.660
I was searching for what happiness meant.

00:22:11.660 --> 00:22:15.030
Aiming for the island in my dreams,

00:22:15.030 --> 00:22:19.510
on a journey with no end!

00:22:21.370 --> 00:22:24.480
Blown by the winds of tomorrow,

00:22:24.480 --> 00:22:27.610
drifting off to who-knows-where,

00:22:27.610 --> 00:22:33.620
amid the waves of time.

00:22:36.260 --> 00:22:38.360
Gourmet News!

00:22:39.560 --> 00:22:41.090
I'm your host, Tina!

00:22:40.830 --> 00:22:46.500
Incredible Acquisition! The 
Sauce that Changed the World!

00:22:41.490 --> 00:22:45.630
I unfortunately wasn't able to film 
that big scoop in the summit banquet,

00:22:45.630 --> 00:22:50.500
but, incredibly, I managed to bring 
back some of the sauce with me!

00:22:50.500 --> 00:22:52.440
Huh? This isn't the sauce...

00:22:52.440 --> 00:22:56.910
That's the Woolstar Sauce! Don't!

00:22:56.910 --> 00:22:58.640
This is so incredibly delicious!

00:22:58.910 --> 00:23:01.510
At least leave a little for me!

00:23:02.010 --> 00:23:04.180
Now, on to the next story!

00:23:06.980 --> 00:23:09.770
We're here at the place made famous by the Gourmet Age.

00:23:09.770 --> 00:23:13.060
Toriko will guide us through the latest in Gourmet Entertainment.

00:23:13.370 --> 00:23:16.430
The Amusement Park of Eating! The Bellyfull City, Gourmet Town!

00:23:16.770 --> 00:23:18.570
Look forward to another heaping helping of fun!
